<p>Hi <%= @user.player_name %>,</p>
<% if @first_move %>
  <p>Both armies are on the board, and <strong>you have the first move</strong> against <%= @opponent.player_name %>.</p>
<% else %>
  <p><strong><%= @opponent.player_name %></strong> has moved. It is your turn (turn <%= @match.full_move %>).</p>
<% end %>
<p><a href="<%= @url %>">Make your move</a></p>
<p>You have seven days to move<%= ", until #{@deadline.utc.strftime('%B %-d at %H:%M UTC')}" if @deadline %>, or you forfeit the match.</p>
